typed construction-scene intermediate representation; global, work-zone, and
interaction USD layers; asset- and scene-level deterministic validation;
whitelisted repair or human escalation; and CPU reports plus RTX task
execution. Label the exchanged artefacts (IFC GUID map, scene JSON, USD layers,
diagnostic JSON, audit log, and task-outcome record) on the connecting arrows.}{
Compiler modules, schemas, CLI entry points, generated artefacts, and the
experiment registry. Editable SVG master and embedded-font PDF.}
\caption{Architecture of \systemname. Deterministic compilation and validation
remain separate from agentic diagnosis and from the downstream simulation
runtime.}
\label{fig:architecture}
\end{figure*}

